  "extractionNotes": "Full-time employee since 2021-09-01 (small employer). The claimant first sent only a leave letter to her employer (maternity 2026-03-01..2026-07-18 and parental 224 days to 2027-02-27; the father will not use the leave). ZUS letters of 2026-03-27 asked the employer for the Z-3 and the claimant for a ZAM by 2026-04-10, otherwise a refusal; the ZAM (maternity + parental) and a continuation Z-3 followed (undated). Grant evidenced only by the file label (right to maternity benefit established). Z-3: fixed salary 6850.14 for 2024-12..2025-10 (2025-07 row not legible; care-benefit absences in 2025-02 and 2025-04, sickness in 2025-09); the continuation Z-3 suggests a sickness benefit before the birth, dates not in the file. Birth date taken as the maternity start. Application date unknown, so the rate is inferred (joint ZAM)."
